WEBVTT

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.397
So there's a whole range
of different nonlethal weapons

00:05:01.421 --> 00:05:03.361
we could give military personnel,

00:05:03.385 --> 00:05:05.292
and there's a whole range of situations

00:05:05.316 --> 00:05:07.269
where they're looking at them and saying,

00:05:07.293 --> 00:05:09.128
"These things would be really useful."

00:05:09.152 --> 00:05:10.556
But as I said,

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.569
the military and the police
are very different.

00:05:13.593 --> 00:05:14.625
(Laughter)

00:05:14.649 --> 00:05:17.380
Yes, you don't have to look
very hard at this to recognize

00:05:17.404 --> 00:05:19.172
that they might be very different.

00:05:19.196 --> 00:05:20.466
In particular,

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.170
the attitude to the use of force

00:05:22.194 --> 00:05:24.262
and the way they're trained to use force

00:05:24.286 --> 00:05:25.866
is especially different.

00:05:26.976 --> 00:05:28.576
The police --

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:31.612
and knowing because I've actually
helped to train police --